The next formula is presented without an assumed named law (1147). [let series]
\begin{equation}q_{1347}\end{equation}

Let $P_{x17}$ be power, $\tau_{x17}$ torque, and $\omega_{x17}$ angular velocity. The rotational identity is $P_{x17}=\tau_{x17}\omega_{x17}$, not the requested force-velocity law.
